  "description": "Truvio PowerTools — a growing suite of admin power tools for Dynamicweb 10 by JustDynamics, in one dedicated \"PowerTools\" area of the administration.\n\nIncluded tools:\n• Security Viewer — pick any security account (role, group, or user) and see its effective content access across pages, grid rows, and paragraphs, with origin explanations.\n• Access Warnings — misconfiguration findings: ineffective group grants, gated sign-in pages, ignored legacy permission columns, orphaned grants.\n• Price Explainer — pick a user (or the anonymous visitor) and a product: can they see it, what do they pay, and why — the assortment that grants or blocks it, the price-matrix row that wins and why every other row lost, the product discounts that apply; switch currency, shop, quantity and date.\n• Operations Console — install health in one place: scheduled tasks (state, runs, who ran them, failing and stale tasks), integration activities (last result, broken task→activity links), logs and storage (log folders and largest tables, retention, growth findings), recent changes.\n• Index & Query Inspector — repositories and indexes with build status and schema, field where-used (dangling and unused fields), a query linter (incl. the blank-parameter leak that returns the whole index), and a live document browser that diffs product documents against the database.\n\nRequires Dynamicweb 10.8 or newer. Issues and feature requests: https://github.com/justdynamics/Truvio.Commerce.PowerTools/issues",
